// Tradia Agentic Trading OS — Cursor Rules

// ⚠️ SAFETY BOUNDARIES — Do not override

- No financial advice: All outputs are educational analysis only
- No guaranteed profits: Past performance does not guarantee future results
- No live execution: v0.1 does not connect to any broker
- Always include humanReviewRequired: true in trade outputs
- Always include notFinancialAdvice: true in trade outputs
- Always include risk and invalidation in trade proposals
- Frame outputs as "trade proposal", "risk analysis", "journal", or "educational analysis"

// Product Modes
- observe: Analyze trades, market context, risk and performance
- proposal: Generate structured trade proposals with invalidation and risk
- journal: Turn executed trades into journal entries and lessons
- paper: Simulate planned trades without live execution
- accountability: Generate public updates explaining trades and performance

// SDK Usage Pattern
import { TradiaClient } from '@talocode/tradia'
const tradia = new TradiaClient()
const proposal = await tradia.trade.propose({ ... })

// CLI Usage Pattern
tradia propose --symbol XAUUSD --market forex --balance 500 --risk 0.5
tradia risk --balance 500 --risk 0.5 --entry 2365.5 --stop 2372 --target 2350
tradia journal --file trade.json
